。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感赋七首 其七","author":"刘崧","text":"飞檄时时急，防边事事虞。\n度关频阅验，鸣柝递传呼。\n干羽终来格，豺狼得尽诛。\n皇恩自远溢，何以慰民痡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月九日将赴豫章夜发瑞州城下二首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"天末云霞暝，城隅烟水深。\n维舟呼不见，渔火坐相侵。\n夜下芙蓉渚，秋高橘子林。\n不眠催解缆，鸣柝正沈沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月九日将赴豫章夜发瑞州城下二首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"未卜西昌返，还寻南浦行。\n清秋千里外，永夜一舟轻。\n风急高河动，星浮积水明。\n苍苍江雾合，起坐怅心惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过松湖闻熊氏往时有花圃特盛","author":"刘崧","text":"寂历松湖市，人家际水烟。\n平沙皆种树，枯港不通船。\n旧隐真堪托，名园已盛传。\n青春花竹丽，载酒定何年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过郑氏隐居承二子之纯之纪留宿赋赠一首","author":"刘崧","text":"流水西山麓，层轩夏木凉。\n昔闻书带草，今过郑公乡。\n展席传诗帙，张灯列酒浆。\n佳儿真好客，倾倒意何长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23853,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓铁柱怡真堂柬左德昭","author":"刘崧","text":"自有幽栖志，长嫌俗境喧。\n喜寻高士宅，得共故人论。\n古井波围柱，深檐石作垣。\n焚香足危坐，清咏五千言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题隐皋亭","author":"刘崧","text":"晚树连虚壁，秋花隐画檐。\n林交风瑟瑟，池迥雨纤纤。\n把酒频移席，翻书欲近帘。\n由来有真趣，出处若为兼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早泊蓼洲时徵乃颜将军赴淮夜捉送途者","author":"刘崧","text":"微火明高碛，危樯倚近城。\n舟人惊暝窜，戎卒问晨征。\n牢落闻鸡犬，喧呼度甲兵。\n江淮方警急，行客倍含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送尧举监税赴进贤","author":"刘崧","text":"送尔司征去，江干秋雨馀。\n由来设关市，不在算舟车。\n客路通城邑，人烟集里墟。\n西风摇落近，回首独踟躇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人之赣州司幕","author":"刘崧","text":"江合城楼迥，秋高幕府清。\n之官宁惮远，论法正须平。\n寒濑鸣砂浅，晴岚隐石横。\n凄凉为客处，浩荡送君情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归次杨林","author":"刘崧","text":"汀树重重转，江船稍稍移。\n浅沙惊欲荡，逆浪故相欺。\n风起占鸦浴，云飞信马蹄。\n凤山明月好，应怪客归迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题空翠楼为东山湛上人赋","author":"刘崧","text":"碧嶂飞甍合，青林画栱高。\n晴天引苍翠，凉月见纤毫。\n木榻飘金磬，春壶净玉醪。\n东山有支遁，临眺使心劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春山伐木图","author":"刘崧","text":"伐木春山里，千峰复万峰。\n蛟龙回别涧，麋鹿引行踪。\n风落崇冈桂，云开绝壁松。\n怀人咏鸣鸟，欲往愧无从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水画二首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"远树层层出，高崖面面开。\n谷深云欲动，江白雨初来。\n楚佩遗仙浦，吴航近钓台。\n故人浑不见，秋暮思悠哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水画二首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"绝壁芙蓉秀，悬崖薜荔高。\n天清闻夕籁，木落见秋毫。\n仙赏谁能继，荣名自可逃。\n时来倚图画，怅尔渺烟涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠翠岩泰上人","author":"刘崧","text":"兰若倚西冈，年深松桂长。\n似闻葛洪井，还近赞公房。\n挂衲云林净，翻经石榻凉。\n下方一回首，烟雾日苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅夕","author":"刘崧","text":"乡梦灯初破，寒窗雨渐疏。\n已愁秋向夕，况苦雁无书。\n异郡危新战，沧江倚旧庐。\n老亲应散疾，藜杖到阶除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月","author":"刘崧","text":"十月惊雷动，千林急雨来。\n民情欣利泽，春令恐为灾。\n暄日犹催杏，清霜不杀荄。\n王师渡淮浦，定遣几时回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南溪","author":"刘崧","text":"溪树绿阴阴，林居夏向深。\n青山谢朓宅，流水伯牙琴。\n采药怀孤往，看花惜共吟。\n北岩如可问，于此息尘心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松下行吟图","author":"刘崧","text":"松下行吟者，翛然不可呼。\n影临秋水迥，兴与暮云孤。\n石角栖书帙，花阴散酒壶。\n青山招隐去，应是笑泥涂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题萧伯高西冈读书处在唐杜审言故居之右","author":"刘崧","text":"萧子读书处，昔年曾一过。\n郭外西原好，门前修竹多。\n雪深犹独卧，日晏亦高歌。\n况近参军宅，清明奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"定上人屡约游山不果近承寄示送孙景贤诗未及和答因刘进士仲炯游青原山赋此奉寄 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"孙宰游山日，僧房赋别时。\n有诗还念我，何处定逢师。\n云甃虫书叶，霜林鹤满枝。\n来游知不厌，空负数幽期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]